      "text": "SOP to VOL — Mesh Rasterization\n\nSOPtoVOLNative rasterizes geometry into a 3D density grid.\nfill_interior=true fills the solid interior (signed distance).\nbandwidth controls the surface thickness in voxels.\n\nTwo windows compare the sharp rasterized result (top)\nvs the blurred version (bottom) for soft glow effects.",
